{"id":"b23177f17eeaa7a2","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-ordinal-notation.md","title":"Ordinal Notation","display":"df-ordinal-notation — Ordinal Notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-ordinal-notation","aliases":["88-df-ordinal-notation"],"display":"df-ordinal-notation — Ordinal Notation","depends_on":["[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-ordinal]]","[[88-df-countable]]","[[88-df-bijective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-ordinal-notation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-ordinal-notation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal-notation — Ordinal Notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44f871cfd68c1a70\" href=\"?note=44f871cfd68c1a70\" title=\"88-df-ordinal\">88-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dba31c144607e57b\" href=\"?note=dba31c144607e57b\" title=\"88-df-countable\">88-df-countable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1fd20a9a341b65d3\" href=\"?note=1fd20a9a341b65d3\" title=\"88-df-bijective\">88-df-bijective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景理论为 ZFC。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\)</span> 的标准程序编号，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(O\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> 是候选记号集与关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NotationClosed}_{88}(O,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{NotationClosed}_{88}(O,R)\\)</span> 是下述闭包谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{88}\">\\(\\mathcal O_{88}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\)</span> 是下述最小闭包记号系统；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_a\">\\(P_a\\)</span> 为记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的严格前驱集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"44f871cfd68c1a70\" href=\"?note=44f871cfd68c1a70\" title=\"88-df-ordinal\">88-df-ordinal</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"dba31c144607e57b\" href=\"?note=dba31c144607e57b\" title=\"88-df-countable\">88-df-countable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1fd20a9a341b65d3\" href=\"?note=1fd20a9a341b65d3\" title=\"88-df-bijective\">88-df-bijective</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 为所有可数序数的集合，在下述断言中固定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NotationValue}_{88}(a,\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{NotationValue}_{88}(a,\\alpha)\\)</span> 是序型谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\">\\(|\\cdot|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\)</span> 是其定义的值图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NotationClosed}_{88}(O,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nO\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land R\\subseteq O^2\\land1\\in O\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in O\\;(2^a\\in O\\land\\langle a,2^a\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in O\\;\n(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\varphi_e)\\subseteq O\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\langle\\varphi_e(k),\\varphi_e(k+1)\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\to\n3\\cdot5^e\\in O\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\langle\\varphi_e(k),3\\cdot5^e\\rangle\\in R\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NotationClosed}_{88}(O,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nO\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land R\\subseteq O^2\\land1\\in O\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in O\\;(2^a\\in O\\land\\langle a,2^a\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in O\\;\n(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\varphi_e)\\subseteq O\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\langle\\varphi_e(k),\\varphi_e(k+1)\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\to\n3\\cdot5^e\\in O\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\langle\\varphi_e(k),3\\cdot5^e\\rangle\\in R\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\mathcal O_{88}\\coloneqq\n\\{a\\in\\mathbb N:\\forall O\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\;\n(\\mathrm{NotationClosed}_{88}(O,R)\\to a\\in O)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\mathcal O_{88}\\coloneqq\n\\{a\\in\\mathbb N:\\forall O\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\;\n(\\mathrm{NotationClosed}_{88}(O,R)\\to a\\in O)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\na&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}b\\leftrightarrow\na,b\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\forall O\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\;\n(\\mathrm{NotationClosed}_{88}(O,R)\\to\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\na&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}b\\leftrightarrow\na,b\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\forall O\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\;\n(\\mathrm{NotationClosed}_{88}(O,R)\\to\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\omega_1\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ord}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\alpha)\\},\n\\qquad\n\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\quad\nP_a\\coloneqq\\{b\\in\\mathcal O_{88}:b&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}a\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\omega_1\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ord}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\alpha)\\},\n\\qquad\n\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\quad\nP_a\\coloneqq\\{b\\in\\mathcal O_{88}:b&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}a\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NotationValue}_{88}(a,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\na\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\land\\mathrm{Ord}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\exists b\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(b,P_a,\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m,n\\in P_a\\;\n(m&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}n\\leftrightarrow b(m)\\in b(n))\\Bigr),\\\\\n|\\cdot|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\langle a,\\alpha\\rangle\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\times\\omega_1:\n\\mathrm{NotationValue}_{88}(a,\\alpha)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NotationValue}_{88}(a,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\na\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\land\\mathrm{Ord}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\exists b\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(b,P_a,\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m,n\\in P_a\\;\n(m&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}n\\leftrightarrow b(m)\\in b(n))\\Bigr),\\\\\n|\\cdot|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\langle a,\\alpha\\rangle\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\times\\omega_1:\n\\mathrm{NotationValue}_{88}(a,\\alpha)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>闭包族非空，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N^2)\">\\((\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N^2)\\)</span> 满足闭包条件；对所有闭包候选同时取交给出真正的最小系统。极限生成规则使用<strong>记号关系中的严格递增</strong>，不先调用尚未定义的序数值映射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\)</span> 是生成规则的传递闭包，不能定义成“所表示序数较小”的全部比较关系；后者会错误地把不同生成分支混在一起。</p>\n<p>值图用严格前驱良序的序型定义，不以“值图已经是函数”为前提。其全定义性、生成子句和恰好表示所有递归序数，是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"17e23d087321028e\" href=\"?note=17e23d087321028e\" title=\"88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties\">88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties</a> 的内容，不再把表示定理偷放进一个所谓的闭包定义中。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 仅提供值图的集合论载体，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\">\\(\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\)</span> 不是同一记号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"44f871cfd68c1a70","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"dba31c144607e57b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-countable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"1fd20a9a341b65d3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"背景理论为 ZFC。固定 $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsym